  "title": "Bob&#39;s Focaccia Turkey Sandwiches",
  "description": "Cucumber adds a crunchy counterpoint to melted provolone on savory focaccia turkey sandwiches. Serve for a light lunch.",
  "authors": [
    "Robert Lockwood"
  ],
